############################# # Exercise Group Introduction #############################
BEGIN_PGML Write an equation to model the scenario. There is no need to solve the equation.
END_PGML
###### # Body ######
BEGIN_PGML [$name] baked a pie at [`[$initial]\,^{\circ}F`] and just took it out of the oven. It immediately starts to cool at a rate of [`[$rate]\,\frac{^{\circ}F}{\text{min}}\text{.}`] How long will it take to cool to [`[$final]\,^{\circ}F\text{?}`] Write an equation to model this scenario. There is no need to solve it.
[@KeyboardInstructions('Use [|t|]* as the variable.')@]**
[_]{$equation}{20}
END_PGML
